<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Adaptive CAT Preparation System — Milestone Report</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Calibri, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11pt;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #222;
      margin: 40px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 20pt;
      color: #0f172a;
      border-bottom: 2pt solid #0f172a;
      padding-bottom: 6pt;
      margin-bottom: 12pt;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 14pt;
      color: #0f172a;
      border-bottom: 1pt solid #cbd5e1;
      padding-bottom: 4pt;
      margin-top: 18pt;
      margin-bottom: 8pt;
    }
    h3 {
      font-size: 12pt;
      color: #334155;
      margin-top: 14pt;
      margin-bottom: 6pt;
    }
    p, li {
      font-size: 11pt;
      color: #334155;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 10pt;
      margin-bottom: 14pt;
    }
    th, td {
      border: 1pt solid #cbd5e1;
      padding: 6pt 8pt;
      font-size: 10pt;
      text-align: left;
    }
    th {
      background-color: #f1f5f9;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .badge {
      background-color: #e2e8f0;
      padding: 2pt 5pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 3pt;
      font-size: 9pt;
    }
    .callout {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border-left: 3pt solid #0f172a;
      padding: 8pt 12pt;
      margin: 12pt 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Adaptive CAT Preparation System — Milestone Summary Report</h1>

  <table style="border: none; margin-bottom: 16pt;">
    <tr style="border: none; background: none;">
      <td style="border: none; width: 50%;"><strong>Repository:</strong> CAT Exam</td>
      <td style="border: none; width: 50%;"><strong>Status:</strong> Milestones 1–5 Complete &amp; Verified</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="border: none; background: none;">
      <td style="border: none;"><strong>Platform:</strong> Next.js 14 App Router + TypeScript</td>
      <td style="border: none;"><strong>Date:</strong> September 28, 2026</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="callout">
    <strong>Executive Architecture Summary:</strong><br>
    The platform has been upgraded from a static question bank into a full adaptive preparation system. The core pedagogical pipeline enforces:
    <br><br>
    <em>Teach &rarr; Solved Example &rarr; Guided Try &rarr; Foundation Practice &rarr; Challenge &rarr; CAT-Style Practice &rarr; Authentic PYQ &rarr; Sectionals &rarr; Full Mocks</em>
  </div>

  <h2>1. Milestone Delivery Status</h2>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 25%;">Milestone</th>
      <th style="width: 60%;">Accomplishments</th>
      <th style="width: 15%;">Result</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Milestone 1: Data Isolation</strong></td>
      <td>
        • Ingested all 664 authentic CAT PYQs across 10 slot papers (CAT 2021–2024).<br>
        • Locked immutable data contracts and isolated with <code>sourceType: "CAT_PYQ"</code>.<br>
        • Preserved original 120-minute 3-section simulator without regressions.
      </td>
      <td><strong>100% Passed</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Milestone 2: Diagnostic Assessment</strong></td>
      <td>
        • Built 12-question diagnostic test runner (4 VARC, 4 DILR, 4 QA) at <code>/diagnostic</code>.<br>
        • Deterministic stage scoring: Beginner (&le;4), Intermediate (5–8), Advanced (&ge;9).<br>
        • Automatic sectional baseline calculation and persistent store updates.
      </td>
      <td><strong>100% Passed</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Milestone 3: Original Question Banks</strong></td>
      <td>
        • Multi-topic original practice pools across QA, DILR, and VARC with <code>sourceType: "ORIGINAL_PRACTICE"</code>.<br>
        • Strict 4-tier difficulty progression (Foundation &rarr; Easy &rarr; Moderate &rarr; Intermediate).<br>
        • Detailed 6-point pedagogical solutions (steps, concept, derivation, common trap, CAT shortcut).
      </td>
      <td><strong>100% Passed</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Milestone 4: Adaptive Practice &amp; UI</strong></td>
      <td>
        • Adaptive solver at <code>/practice</code> with automatic difficulty tier gating.<br>
        • Intelligent TITA evaluator normalizing sequences, currency symbols, decimals, and fractions.<br>
        • 6-stage topic mastery mode at <code>/learn</code> with dynamic progress gauges.<br>
        • Stage-tailored Home page (<code>/</code>) with Persona Switcher (Beginner/Intermediate/Advanced).
      </td>
      <td><strong>100% Passed</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Milestone 5: Verification &amp; Build</strong></td>
      <td>
        • TypeScript check: <code>tsc --noEmit</code> completed with 0 errors.<br>
        • Production build: <code>next build</code> compiled all 21 routes with 0 errors.
      </td>
      <td><strong>100% Passed</strong></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2>2. Key Source File Inventory</h2>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <th>File Path</th>
      <th>Role in Adaptive System</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>src/lib/types/adaptive.ts</code></td>
      <td>Data contracts for stages, profiles, tiers, diagnostic outcomes, and solutions.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>src/lib/data/diagnosticQuestions.ts</code></td>
      <td>12 curated diagnostic items with detailed answer keys and explanations.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>src/lib/data/originalQuestions/</code></td>
      <td>Original practice question modules covering QA, DILR, and VARC topics.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>src/lib/data/mockDatabase.ts</code></td>
      <td>Aggregates authentic PYQs and original practice questions with strict source separation.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>src/lib/store/appStore.ts</code></td>
      <td>Zustand store handling adaptive profile, accuracy tracking, velocity, and stage transitions.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>src/app/diagnostic/page.tsx</code></td>
      <td>Diagnostic test runner, timer, scoring engine, and personalized placement report.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>src/app/practice/page.tsx</code></td>
      <td>Adaptive question solver with attempt logging, pacing stats, and mistake analysis.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>src/app/learn/page.tsx</code></td>
      <td>6-stage topic mastery journey with progressive concept challenges.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>src/app/page.tsx</code></td>
      <td>Adaptive dashboard rendering tailored pathways and developer persona testing switcher.</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2>3. Live Preview &amp; Verification</h2>
  <p>
    The local development server is active and accessible at <strong>http://localhost:3000</strong>. Users can immediately test all features including the 12-question diagnostic test, 6-stage learning modules, adaptive practice drills, and the stage switcher.
  </p>

</body>
</html>
